## What Changes in Output

### Before (current verdict):
```
Model: SDR Lead Gen Agency
P50: $2K-5K/mo
Sleep test: PARTIAL
ROI: [not computed]
```

### After (with Intelligence Layer):
```
Portfolio Allocation: $500 -> 3 assets
  $200 -> Mini Course (P50 ROI: 2.0x, sleep: YES)
  $200 -> Chrome Extension (P50 ROI: 0.5x, sleep: YES)
  $100 -> Digital Templates (P50 ROI: 1.0x, sleep: YES)

Portfolio P50 monthly passive: $150/mo
Portfolio P50 12-month return: $600 (1.2x on $500)
Portfolio P10 (worst case): -$200 (0.6x)

SDR Lead Gen NOT in portfolio:
  Reason: sleep_test=NO, leverage=LABOR
  Math: $2K-5K/mo is WAGE, not RETURN ON CAPITAL
  Compare: $150/mo passive > $5K/mo labor (per hour, passive wins at month 8)
```

**Key shift:** The system now COMPUTES what $500 should do, then SEARCHES for instances within computed winners — instead of asking Google "what business for $500?" and getting labor answers.

