## Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|------|----------|------------|
| Asset class data stale/wrong | HIGH | Zone tags on every data point, annual refresh, minimum 3 sources per class |
| Over-fitting to historical ROI | MEDIUM | Monte Carlo with wide distributions, survival analysis filter |
| Computation creates false precision | MEDIUM | Always show P10-P90 range, never single-point estimate |
| Founder ignores portfolio, picks labor | LOW | Show hourly-rate comparison: "$5K/mo labor @ 160h = $31/hr vs $150/mo passive @ 2h = $75/hr" |
| Existing calc engines don't fit new use case | LOW | Kelly/Monte Carlo are generic — just need new input format |

