1. Given "$500 capital" query, system returns portfolio allocation BEFORE any web search
2. Web searches target specific asset class instances, not "business ideas"
3. Verdict includes computed P10/P50/P90 portfolio return
4. Labor models are explicitly compared against passive portfolio on per-hour basis
5. All 45 existing tests + new tests pass
6. Stage0 checklist updated with portfolio checks

